Zápis do systémového logu potřebuje cgo a NDK, takže kontrola typů pro
Android s vypnutým cgo končila na chybějící funkci. Náhradní prázdná
funkce platí jen bez cgo; skutečná knihovna se staví vždy s cgo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 libtailscale/log_nocgo.go | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libtailscale/log_nocgo.go

diff --git a/libtailscale/log_nocgo.go b/libtailscale/log_nocgo.go
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b5bdf18
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libtailscale/log_nocgo.go
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+// Copyright (c) Phone21
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+
+//go:build !cgo
+
+package libtailscale
+
+// initLogging is implemented in log.go, which needs cgo and the NDK (it
+// writes to logcat). The real library is always built with cgo; this stub
+// only lets the package be type-checked and vetted without the NDK:
+//
+//	GOOS=android GOARCH=arm64 CGO_ENABLED=0 ./tool/go build ./libtailscale/...
+func initLogging(appCtx AppContext) {}
